"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/grovers/extracted-outputs/ee7a59ac-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Check your understanding {#check-your-understanding-2}"
msgstr "Verifica la tua comprensione {#check-your-understanding-2}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You should have correctly obtained your partner's target state(s). If you "
